<p>Identity is one of the most critical — and often underestimated — design challenges in modern applications. <em>Identity in Modern Applications</em> examines the full spectrum of identity management: authentication, authorization, session management, and the architectural choices that make or break the user experience and security posture of your application.</p>

<h2 id="what-youll-learn">What You’ll Learn</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Modern authentication patterns including OAuth 2.0, OpenID Connect, and SAML</li>
  <li>Authorization models: RBAC, ABAC, and when to use each</li>
  <li>How to manage identity across microservices and distributed systems</li>
  <li>Practical guidance on common identity providers and integration approaches</li>
</ul>
